.\" ###### Setup ############################################################
.Dd November 27, 2026
.Dt random\-sleep 1
.Os random\-sleep
.\" ###### Name #############################################################
.Sh NAME
.Nm random\-sleep
.Nd waits for a randomly selected time
.\" ###### Synopsis #########################################################
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm random\-sleep
.Ar min\_delay
.Ar max\_delay
.br
.Op Fl q | Fl \-quiet
.Op Fl w | Fl \-verbose
.Nm random\-sleep
.Op Fl h | Fl \-help
.Nm random\-sleep
.Op Fl v | Fl \-version
.\" ###### Description ######################################################
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm random\-sleep
waits for a randomly selected time span chosen uniformly from the interval
.Bq Ar min\_delay , Ar max\_delay
in seconds, where
.No 0.0 <= Ar min\_delay No <= Ar max\_delay .
Fractional seconds are supported. By default,
.Nm
operates quietly unless
.Fl w
or
.Fl \-verbose
is specified.
.\" ###### Arguments ########################################################
.Sh ARGUMENTS
The following arguments and options are available:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Ar min\_delay
The minimum delay in seconds (finite floating\-point value >= 0.0).
.It Ar max\_delay
The maximum delay in seconds (finite floating\-point value >=
.Ar min\_delay ) .
.It Fl q | Fl \-quiet
Quiet mode: suppresses status output (default).
.It Fl w | Fl \-verbose
Verbose mode: prints the selected sleep duration and a wake\-up message.
.It Fl h | Fl \-help
Prints the program's command\-line parameters and exits.
.It Fl v | Fl \-version
Prints the program version and exits.
.El
.\" ###### Exit status ######################################################
.Sh EXIT STATUS
The
.Nm
tool exits with 0 on success, and >0 in case of an error.
.\" ###### Examples #########################################################
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -bullet
.It
random\-sleep 0 3600
.It
random\-sleep 0 300 \-\-verbose
.It
random\-sleep 60.0 120.5 \-w
.It
random\-sleep 0.10 0.50 \-q
.It
random\-sleep \-\-help
.It
random\-sleep \-h
.It
random\-sleep \-\-version
.It
random\-sleep \-v
.El
